{"mala": [{"id": "mala", "headword": "मल", "headword_slp1": "mala", "fold": "mala", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "मल [mala], a. [मृज्यते शोध्यते मृज्-कल टिलोपः Tv.]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Dirty, foul; आमिषं यच्च पूर्वेषां राजसं च मलं भृशम् Rām.7.74.16.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Mean, covetous.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Unbelieving, infidel, godless.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Wicked.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "लः, लम् Dirt, filth, impurity, dust, any impure matter; मलदायकाः खलाः K.2; छाया न मूर्छति मलोपहतप्रसादे शुद्धे तु दर्पणतले सुलभावकाशा Ś.7.32.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Dregs, refuse, sediment, excrement, feces, dung.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Dross (of metals), rust, alloy.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Moral taint or impurity, sin; फलैधःकुसुमस्तेयमधैर्यं च मलावहम् Ms.11.7.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Any impure secretion of the body; (according to Manu these excretions are twelve: वसा शुक्रमसृङ् मज्जा मूत्रविड् घ्राणकर्णविट् । श्लेष्माश्रुदूषिका स्वेदो द्वादशैते नृणां मलाः Ms.5.135).", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Camphor.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Cuttle-fish bone.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Tanned leather; a leather-garment.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "The three humours of the body (वात, पित्त and कफ). -लम् A kind of base metal.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Comp. अपकर्षणम् removing the dirt, purification.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "removal of sin.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "अपहा a particular preparation.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "N. of a river; नन्दिनी नलिनी सीता मालती च मलापहा.-अयनम् the rectum. -अरिः a kind of natron. -अव- रोधः constipation of the bowels. -आकर्षिन् m. a sweeper, a scavenger. -आभ a. dirty-looking. -आवाह a.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "causing dirt, dirtying, soiling.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "defi